    <string name="squeezer_markers_dialog_title">Mayelana nalezi izikali</string>
    <string name="squeezer_markers_compressed_before_description">Inikhiwo ise-SD Maid ayikwelisile fayela eli. Ukuwelisa kabusha kumabuya inkalankala futhi kusiphakamisa kancane.</string>
    <string name="squeezer_markers_hdr_depth_description">Lesisithombe sine-HDR noma idatha yejuba okuthi isikweliso akukhula ukugcina. Isithombe se-HDR sibuyela njengejwayelekile, futhi isithombe somfanekiso siphulukane idatha yejuba esetshenziswayo ekubhideni kwengqondo yomhlaba.</string>
    <string name="squeezer_markers_motion_photo_description">Lesi isithombe se-Motion. Isikweliso sugcina isithombe esimileyo futhi sisuluza ulwimi lovidiyo.</string>
    <string name="squeezer_markers_downscaled_description">Lesisithombe sibanzi noma siphakeme kunezinso 8192. Isikweliso nakho kwahlasela isigexe sokubonakalisa.</string>
